ed, and the legacy OS/kernel remained in place.","limitations":["Node2's restart evidence did not directly recheck its local /srv handover files after reboot, so its provider-wide restart data-state evidence is less complete than node1's.","The final lifecycle listening-socket observation for node1 was empty despite executor evidence showing the SMTP listener and successful SMTP behavior shortly beforehand; this appears inconsistent or collector-limited and modestly lowers confidence.","Failed-service collection was unsupported on this pre-systemd platform, although direct SysV service status and functional SMTP tests showed recovery."]}
